<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;">Mayor Andrew J. Ginther and the Office of Diversity and Inclusion are pleased to invite you to the ConnectUS Small Business Conference &amp; Expo to be held on October 2, 2019 at the Greater Columbus Convention Center.</p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;">ConnectUS will provide tangible tips, resources and business opportunities to start-ups, entrepreneurs and small business owners throughout the region. Engage with us and public/private sector buyers, procurement officers, supplier diversity professionals, business owners, and industry influencers to discuss best practices in supplier diversity to build and grow your business.</p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;"><a href="https://iplanprime.eventready.com/index.cfm?event_id=547&fuseaction=reg.page&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery" target="_blank" title="registration" rel="noopener" style="color: #0062B2; text-decoration: underline; -ms-word-break: break-all; word-break: break-word; -webkit-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;"><strong><em>Register Now</em></strong></a>  for the conference! To learn more visit our website at: <a href="https://www.columbus.gov/odi/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery" target="_blank" title="Diversity" rel="noopener" style="color: #0062B2; text-decoration: underline; -ms-word-break: break-all; word-break: break-word; -webkit-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;">Columbus.gov/diversity</a>. <a href="https://www.columbus.gov/ConnectUs/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery" target="_blank" title="conference" rel="noopener" style="color: #0062B2; text-decoration: underline; -ms-word-break: break-all; word-break: break-word; -webkit-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;"></a></p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;"> </p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;"> </p>
